<% page_title "Privacy Policy" %>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1 class="h-page">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="card mt-8 p-6 md:p-8 prose-ink">
    <p>We collect your name, email address, optional phone number, which lessons you've completed, and your assessment answers and results. We use this only to guide you through All In and to help our pastoral team serve you well.</p>
    <p>Your assessment results are visible to you and to the All In team who meets with you. We don't sell or share your information with anyone outside <%= settings[:church_name] %>.</p>
    <p>Videos are hosted by Vimeo, which may set cookies necessary for playback. This site is served through Cloudflare for security.</p>
    <p>To see, change, or delete your information, use Account or email <%= mail_to settings[:church_email] %>.</p>
    <p class="text-mute text-sm">Replace this placeholder with a policy reviewed by your church's leadership before launch.</p>
  </div>
</div>
